---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy  SilTest Semiconductors" description="How SilTest Semiconductors handles personal data, in line with the GDPR.">
  <Header />
  <section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="rv in"><span class="eyebrow">Legal</span><h1>Privacy Policy</h1></div></div></section>
  <section style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap legal rv">
    <div class="flag">Draft template. This privacy policy must be reviewed and completed by a qualified person before launch, in particular the sections on the contact form processor and hosting, which involve data transfer outside the EU.</div>
    <h2>Controller</h2>
    <p>SilTest Semiconductors GmbH, Kleve, Germany. Email: <a href="mailto:info@siltest.com">info@siltest.com</a>. For details, see our <a href="/imprint">Imprint</a>.</p>
    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>We take the protection of your personal data seriously. This site is designed to collect as little personal data as possible. This page explains what we collect, why, and the rights you have under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).</p>
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>This website is hosted on GitHub Pages, a service of GitHub, Inc., United States. When you visit the site, GitHub may process technical connection data such as your IP address in server logs. [PLACEHOLDER: confirm and describe the legal basis and data transfer safeguards for hosting.]</p>
    <h2>Contact form</h2>
    <p>When you use our contact form, the details you enter (such as your name, email, company, and message) are transmitted to us through Formspree, a service based in the United States, and then reach us at info@siltest.com. We use this data only to respond to your enquiry. [PLACEHOLDER: confirm the legal basis, retention period, and data transfer safeguards, for example standard contractual clauses, for this US processor.]</p>
    <h2>Payments</h2>
    <p>Purchases are handled by Stripe on Stripe's own checkout pages. We do not receive or store your card details. Please see Stripe's own privacy policy for how they process your data.</p>
    <h2>Embedded videos</h2>
    <p>We embed videos from YouTube in privacy-enhanced mode. No data is sent to YouTube until you actively click to play a video. Once you play a video, YouTube may process data according to its own privacy policy.</p>
    <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p>This website does not set tracking cookies and does not use third-party analytics at this time. [PLACEHOLDER: update if analytics or cookies are added later.]</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Under the GDPR you have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, data portability, and objection. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority. To exercise any of these rights, contact us at info@siltest.com.</p>
    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy as the website evolves. This version is dated [PLACEHOLDER: date].</p>

  </div></section>
  <Footer />
</Base>
